<div class="panel tips">
  <h3>What happens next</h3>
  <ol class="mini-steps">
    <li><strong>We review it.</strong> Someone on our team reads every submission, usually within two working days.</li>
    <li><strong>We may call you.</strong> If something's unclear we'll ask, rather than just declining it.</li>
    <li><strong>It goes live.</strong> You'll see the decision, and any note from us, on your dashboard.</li>
    <li><strong>We screen buyers.</strong> Enquiries and offers come to us first, so you only deal with serious people.</li>
  </ol>
</div>
<div class="panel tips">
  <h3>Listings that sell faster usually have…</h3>
  <ul class="ticks">
    <li>Real assay numbers, even rough ones</li>
    <li>Clear photos of workings and samples</li>
    <li>Honest notes on what's <em>missing</em> (no EIA, no report yet)</li>
    <li>Access details: tar vs. dirt road, distance from town</li>
    <li>Water and power situation</li>
  </ul>
</div>
